Mechanism
T1 Semantic Drift Terminological consistency: 
vocabulary stays stable and 
matches canonical 
definitions
A term’s operative meaning 
drifts without explicit 
redefinition
T2 False State Injection State provenance: outputs 
trace to steps that actually 
occurred
The pipeline asserts a 
decision or result that never 
happened
T3 Compression Distortion Compression fidelity: 
summarization preserves 
meaning and rationale
Compaction keeps the 
conclusion, drops the 
reasoning
T4 State Supersession Failure State coherence: one"""@en .

